    "description": "The Official Johnny Appleseed Festival, base on an 1842\r\nperiod timeline, celebrating the life and times of John Chapman aka\r\nJohnny Appleseed now meets the 21st century.  Our app helps you find\r\nvendors, food and all the fun during the 2 day festival.  The festival\r\nis always the 3rd full weekend in September.  The dates always change,\r\nbut the weekend never does.",
